Z||000000||AusFiero||07-29-2001||10:55 AM||||Well ok it is important probably to me only. But here I have been sitting as a lone Fiero guy from down under. No cruising to go on. No Fieros to check out. Generally doing nothing Fiero related in a group except here. Tonight guess what. I found contact details for The Fiero Club of Australia...WOOOHOOOO. They are based less than an hour from my place  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. <BR>Now I wonder how many members they have. Oh who cares how many, I found a club I found a club.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/ausfiero1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A> | <A HREF="http://www.auto-alley.com" TARGET=_blank>Fiero Accessories</A>||202.139.20.3||reg||10
